A-Mem-Fast builds on the MIT-licensed A-Mem research repository:
https://github.com/WujiangXu/A-mem
Pinned upstream baseline: 0c8039f28fdcc08189a23c07a3437d9d2482f9c2.
Original attribution and license remain in LICENSE; the original README is
preserved in docs/UPSTREAM_README.md.

This project adds the fast_amem package, scripts, tests, benchmark reports
and documentation. The bundled LoCoMo data and original figures come from
the upstream repository.

LoCoMo dataset: Maharana et al., "Evaluating Very Long-Term Conversational
Memory of LLM Agents" (ACL 2024), https://github.com/snap-research/locomo.
The dataset has a separate Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
International license; see data/LICENSE-LOCOMO.txt and data/README.md. The
dataset license also applies to dataset contents and excerpts in reports.
